# Schwag -- a bud gone wrong: seedy, stemmy, weak.
#
# The MATRIX is item/beldia_buds.png's shape (itself the shared bud outline), so it reads as "a bud"
# before it reads as anything else. The palette drains it: every green goes to a dull, dark brown
# and the hairs to a darker one, with no green and no bright tone left -- the plant's colour, cured
# badly. Darker than Beldía's bud on purpose: at slot size the two must never be confused.
# Three pale seeds with a dark seam each (c over e) and a stalk poking out below are the two things
# that make schwag schwag: it is sold by weight with the seeds and stems still in it.
#
# PLACEHOLDER: derived art, not drawn. Redraw or retone freely.

